WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.354
That night, the jailer's daughter returned.

2
00:00:04.355 --> 00:00:06.765
Her aunt was with her.

3
00:00:06.766 --> 00:00:10.904
The aunt carried a big bag.

4
00:00:10.905 --> 00:00:14.136
"Here, Mr. Toad!" said the washwoman.

5
00:00:14.137 --> 00:00:16.325
"I have your clothes."

6
00:00:16.326 --> 00:00:20.648
"And here is something for you!" said Toad.

7
00:00:20.649 --> 00:00:24.463
He gave her four gold coins.

8
00:00:24.464 --> 00:00:27.312
The old woman opened the bag.

9
00:00:27.313 --> 00:00:32.065
"Here's my old dress and an apron," she said.

10
00:00:32.066 --> 00:00:36.101
She gave Toad a shawl and a bonnet too.

11
00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:41.391
"Now you must tie me up," said the washwoman.

12
00:00:41.392 --> 00:00:44.399
"What?" asked Toad, surprised.

13
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.707
The washwoman explained.

14
00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:49.910
"People will think you did it," she said.

15
00:00:49.911 --> 00:00:53.611
"I don't want them to know I helped you."

16
00:00:53.612 --> 00:00:57.059
"What a wonderful idea!" said Toad.

17
00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:59.897
"You are a very clever woman.

18
00:00:59.898 --> 00:01:03.896
Everyone will think I'm dangerous!"

19
00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:07.632
Toad tied up the washwoman.

20
00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:12.302
"Now," said the jailer's daughter, "it's your turn, Toad.

21
00:01:12.303 --> 00:01:14.484
Take off your coat."

22
00:01:14.485 --> 00:01:18.899
She helped Toad put on the dress and apron.

23
00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:21.097
"Here's the shawl," she said.

24
00:01:21.098 --> 00:01:22.762
"And the bonnet!"

25
00:01:22.763 --> 00:01:25.703
Toad looked at himself.

26
00:01:25.704 --> 00:01:30.769
"I don't look so dangerous now," he said sadly.

27
00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:35.033
"You look just like my aunt!" the daughter said.

28
00:01:35.034 --> 00:01:37.701
"Will it work?" Toad asked.

29
00:01:37.702 --> 00:01:40.774
"Just act like an old washwoman.

30
00:01:40.775 --> 00:01:44.463
And don't talk so much," said the jailer's daughter.

31
00:01:44.464 --> 00:01:46.812
"Good-bye, Toad," she said.

32
00:01:46.813 --> 00:01:50.744
"And good luck."

